From 68230767ad433a2fdd273389323c9c9836e9fabd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Lu=C3=ADs=20Duarte?= <lduarte@cloudflare.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:32:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Generate anonymous table objects

Wrap misparented table-internal boxes, group stray cells into implicit rows, and retain ordinary element content inside a table. Refresh anonymous table styles during incremental restyles, and handle display:contents with the current traversal.

Co-authored-by: hotty Agent <hotty@neuroplast.io>
